msgid "分布式训练"
msgstr "Distributed Training"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_training.rst:113
#: a5958a474b3d45c6b2d7904d87ac8554
msgid ""
"XPU 的分布式训练配置与 :doc:`分布式训练 <../../advanced/distributed>` 文档描述的基本一致，卡间通信使用 "
"oneCCL（``xccl`` 后端）。本节主要介绍 XPU 环境下的特定配置。"
msgstr ""
"Distributed training configuration on XPU is largely the same as "
"described in :doc:`Distributed Training <../../advanced/distributed>`; "
"inter-card communication uses oneCCL (the ``xccl`` backend). This section"
" covers XPU-specific settings."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_training.rst:118
#: 3cf15eb421b7441b8061d28bd10a8255
msgid "关键环境变量"
msgstr "Key Environment Variables"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_training.rst:120
#: 66032b90dea64e2692bcf9be0710baac
msgid "**OPTIM_TORCH** (多卡训练必需)"
msgstr "**OPTIM_TORCH** (required for multi-card training)"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_training.rst:122
#: bbc6010aa4f342c2bca75f488ab91db0
msgid ""
"在物理机上进行多卡训练时，**必须** 设置 ``OPTIM_TORCH=0``。默认配置会开启 PyTorch 的 "
"``expandable_segments`` 显存分配方式，该方式在 XPU 上会导致多卡 DDP "
"训练出现段错误（``SIGSEGV``）。Docker 镜像中已默认设置该变量。"
msgstr ""
"For multi-card training on bare metal, you **must** set "
"``OPTIM_TORCH=0``. The default configuration enables PyTorch's "
"``expandable_segments`` memory allocation, which causes a segmentation "
"fault (``SIGSEGV``) in multi-card DDP training on XPU. The Docker image "
"sets this variable by default."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_training.rst:128
#: 9daa6dad94244dd58247a23f226e03da
msgid "**ZE_AFFINITY_MASK** (单机/多机均需关注)"
msgstr ""
"**ZE_AFFINITY_MASK** (relevant for both single-node and multi-node "
"training)"

