msgid ""
"部分依赖（如 ``liger-kernel``）会安装 CUDA 版本的 ``triton`` 包，覆盖 XPU 版本的 ``triton-"
"xpu``。请使用 ``pip install --no-deps`` 安装这些依赖，并通过 ``pip list | grep triton``"
" 确认只安装了 ``triton-xpu``。"
msgstr ""
"Some dependencies (such as ``liger-kernel``) install the CUDA ``triton`` "
"package, which overrides the XPU ``triton-xpu``. Install these "
"dependencies with ``pip install --no-deps`` and confirm with ``pip list |"
" grep triton`` that only ``triton-xpu`` is installed."

